---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Schema from '../../components/Schema.astro';

const title = 'Ultra-Quiet Range Hood Series - 35dB - HouseTech Group News';
const description = 'HouseTech Group launches WhisperSilence ultra-quiet range hood series with 35dB noise level, magnetic levitation motor, active noise cancellation, and 40% turbulence reduction.';

const articleSchema = {
  headline: 'HouseTech Launches Ultra-Quiet Range Hood Series at 35dB Noise Level',
  description: 'WhisperSilence series delivers 35dB operation through magnetic levitation motor, active noise cancellation, and 40% turbulence noise reduction across 6 models.',
  image: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png',
  datePublished: '2023-05-10',
  author: { name: 'HouseTech Group' },
  publisher: {
    name: 'HouseTech Group',
    logo: { url: 'https://www.housetech-ch.com/logo-housetech.png' }
  }
};

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'What is the noise level of HouseTech ultra-quiet range hoods?',
    answer: 'HouseTech ultra-quiet range hoods operate at 35dB, equivalent to a quiet library.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How much turbulence noise is reduced versus conventional hoods?',
    answer: 'AeroAcoustic housing design reduces turbulence noise by 40% versus conventional designs.'
  },
  {
    question: 'What motor technology enables ultra-quiet operation?',
    answer: 'Magnetic levitation motor technology eliminates mechanical friction noise sources.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Does the series include active noise cancellation?',
    answer: 'Yes, built-in active noise cancellation generates inverse sound waves to cancel noise.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How many models are in the WhisperSilence ultra-quiet series?',
    answer: 'The WhisperSilence series includes 6 models across different mounting configurations.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Is the 35dB noise level measured at maximum speed?',
    answer: '35dB measured at typical operating speed with full extraction performance.'
  },
  {
    question: 'What mounting options are available in the ultra-quiet series?',
    answer: 'Available in wall-mounted, island, and under-cabinet mounting configurations.'
  }
];
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Schema type="article" data={articleSchema} />
  <Schema type="faq" data={{ items: faqItems }} />
  <Header activeNav="news" />
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/news">News</a> / <span>Product Launch</span>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container">
      <article class="content-area" style="max-width: 850px;">
        
        <header class="article-header">
          <span class="article-category">Product Launch</span>
          <h1 class="article-title">Ultra-Quiet Range Hood Series: 35dB Sound Barrier</h1>
          <div class="article-meta-info">
            <span>📅 May 2023</span>
            <span>🏷️ Product Launch</span>
            <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
          </div>
        </header>

        <figure class="article-image-figure">
          <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #0369a1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);">
            <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.3)" stroke-width="1">
              <path d="M11 5L6 9H2v6h4l5 4V5z"/>
              <path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 010 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 010 7.07"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="article-image-caption">Ultra-Quiet Range Hood Technology</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="article-body">
          <p>HouseTech launches WhisperSilence ultra-quiet range hood series operating at 35dB, equivalent to library-level quiet conversation. Traditional range hoods typically run at 50-60dB, representing 15-25dB reduction and approximately 70% perceived noise decrease for users.</p>
          
          <p>Magnetic levitation motor technology eliminates mechanical friction noise with fully suspended rotor operation. Motor lifespan exceeds 60,000 hours, 2x longer than traditional bearing motors. Near-zero vibration transfer suppresses noise generation at the source.</p>
          
          <h2>Noise Reduction Technology System</h2>
          
          <p>AeroAcoustic duct design achieves 40% turbulence noise reduction through CFD-optimized airflow pathways. Impeller blade angles refined through 1200+ simulation iterations reduce flow separation and vortex generation. Duct system noise reduced by 8dB+ at equivalent airflow rates.</p>
          
          <p>Active noise cancellation system includes 4 high-sensitivity microphones and 2 low-frequency speakers generating real-time inverse sound waves. 10-15dB noise reduction depth targets 200-1000Hz motor electromagnetic noise band. System response time ≤10ms adapts to speed changes in real time.</p>
          
          <p>Complete unit employs 5-layer composite damping structure with 45 Shore A rubber pads isolating motor-housing vibration transfer. 25mm thick internal acoustic foam achieves ≥0.85 absorption coefficient. Bottom air outlet features silencing chamber reducing exit noise by 3-5dB.</p>
          
          <h2>Product Series & Market</h2>
          
          <p>WhisperSilence series includes 6 models covering wall-mounted, island, and under-cabinet installation types. Airflow range from 600m³/h to 1200m³/h accommodates various kitchen space requirements. All models maintain 35dB quiet level without noise increase at higher performance settings.</p>
          
          <p>European premium appliance retailers report strong reception with ultra-quiet products capturing 45% of high-end series sales within 3 months. Highest adoption in open-concept kitchens and apartment projects with 60%+ specification rate in new developments. 30-50% price premium over standard products.</p>
          
          <p>HouseTech 35dB ultra-quiet range hoods provide OEM partners premium market differentiation through magnetic levitation motor, active cancellation, and 40% turbulence reduction technologies.</p>
        </div>

        <nav class="article-nav">
          <a href="/news/european-distributor-partnership" class="article-nav-link">
            <span class="article-nav-label">← Previous</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">European Partnership</span>
          </a>
          <a href="/news/energy-efficient-eu-aplusplus" class="article-nav-link" style="margin-left:auto;text-align:right;">
            <span class="article-nav-label">Next →</span>
            <span class="article-nav-title">Energy Efficient Products</span>
          </a>
        </nav>

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:var(--spacing-xl);">
          <a href="/news" class="btn btn-accent-outline">← Back to All News</a>
        </div>

      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
